{"title":"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Anna and Yao are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/1/5510c8dcd9dfba33ac0feadc0cabc4321d3f8ef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42 \\text{ km}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" /> apart. They jog towards each other along a straight road. Anna jogs at a constant rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca6ebc442e32ac985209ecb53d36df7ffc27da06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\text{ km}/\\text{h}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> and Yao jogs at a constant rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/9/9b9d846845d209ebfe065335088039eba40bca25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\text{ km}/\\text{h}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" />. When they meet, how much farther has Yao travelled than Anna?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa0a1b439d46fa410c174766f67bd14bce177a87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 6 \\text{ km} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2 \\text{ km} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4 \\text{ km} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 500 \\text{ g} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 300 \\text{ g}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"499\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The distance between the two decreases at a rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/4/4148191890b42623dc14776d4f78d1efff3eaeb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 8 = 14 \\frac{\\text{km}}{\\text{h}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"38\" />. This means they meet after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/4/7b4f72bd74ca169e13ba9f8a8ec23fb10a4b432b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{42}{14} = 3 \\text{ h}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"72\" height=\"38\" />. The difference between their two speeds is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/0/700a076120993cbf16c0579a1ed33402c7153e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 - 6 = 2 \\frac{\\text{km}}{\\text{h}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" />, so Yao has travelled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/d/2cdc4929f06bb76eafbc1e18b75bc7d55d824142.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 6 \\text{ km}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"151\" height=\"30\" /> farther than Anna.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\